Additional information:

Included in the zip are JTLTTVTR.MP and TVTRJTLT.MP which are paths
to and from the start of this loop.

This path loops the entire village, but avoids the perms.

This path integrates with the module 7 bundle which can also be found on
MegaMud Online.

Area damagers do incredibly well on this path.
